msgid "Using JWT RBAC"
msgstr "Usando JWT RBAC"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This guide explains how your Quarkus application can utilize https://github.com/smallrye/smallrye-jwt/[SmallRye JWT]\n"
"to verify https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7519[JSON Web Token]s, represent them as MicroProfile JWT `org.eclipse.microprofile.jwt.JsonWebToken`\n"
"and provide secured access to the Quarkus HTTP endpoints using Bearer Token Authorization and https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Role-based_access_control[Role-Based Access Control]."
msgstr "Este guia explica como o seu aplicativo Quarkus pode utilizar o link:https://github.com/smallrye/smallrye-jwt/[SmallRye JWT] para verificar link:https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7519[os JSON Web Tokens] , representá-los como MicroProfile JWT `org.eclipse.microprofile.jwt.JsonWebToken` e fornecer acesso seguro aos endpoints HTTP do Quarkus usando a Autorização de Token de Portador e o link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Role-based_access_control[Controle de Acesso Baseado em Função] ."

